      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STORM (4) has a strong record this track and trip with three wins and three placings from nine starts. Scored by half a length last time (22.36) in a Restricted WIN over 390m at this track. Looks a key chance on best form. ZIPPING EVERDEEN (1) struggled to get involved last start after missing the jump at this track, but prior to that won by 3 lengths at this track (22.15) beating Noble Dash in a Rank Limit - Grade 5 on October 15. Is yet to miss the placings from this draw, including two wins, from six starts. Has the ability to give this a shake. LILAH RAINBOW (7) last start finished 5th over 300m at Healesville beaten 4.5 lengths (17.17) behind Nebula Bale in a Grade 5 on October 25. Racing well and has to be included. Something for the Multiples: SWEET MILLIE (8)",
